<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Novellus raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Novellus raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- PaineWebber analyst Gunnar Miller said he upgraded Novellus Systems Inc to attractive from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The 1997 earnings estimate was raised to $4.25 a share from $3.75 and the 1998 estimate was increased to $5.55 a share from $5.00 a share.</p>
<p>-- Earlier on Monday, Novellus and Applied Material Inc said they reached a settlement over a patent dispute that calls for Novellus to pay $80 million in damages to Applied. The companies said the settlement ends all outstanding litigation.</p>
<p>-- Novellus gained 8-1/8 to 77-1/2.</p>
</text>
